{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><div class=\"contentTxt\"><p>【Now新聞台】【07:00】三名航天員已進入飛船返回艙。</p></div>\n<div class=\"contentTxt\"><p>【06:02】神二十四乘組湯洪波、武毅及阿里陸續進入飛船。</p></div>\n<div class=\"contentTxt\"><p>【05:55】神二十四乘組湯洪波、武毅及阿里抵達酒泉衛星發射中心，準備進入飛船。</p></div>\n<div class=\"contentTxt\"><p>【05:32】神二十四乘組指令長由湯洪波擔任，帶同航天員武毅及阿里一同現身圓夢園廣場，向在場的民眾揮手，再逐一登上專車，在車隊的護送下，前往發射場。</p></div>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T23:24:21.784662+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":175,"images":0,"source":"Now 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T23:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T23:17:49.125101+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T23:17:49.125101+00:00","content_hash":"939bd46c2efb0e5b85846d8679a54e3b59bdda75e8b180b3d9401f4e03754ae1","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}